# Scenarios

## Which skill

| You have | Use | What happens |
| --- | --- | --- |
%% cc
| A task, question or rough idea; no plan yet | `/native-routed-{host} <task>` | This session designs the plan from the worker's exploration, then dispatches implementation and review |
| An agreed plan, a spec file, or one ticket | `/native-implement-routed-{host} <plan or ticket>` | Tests first, review, commits, with the worker implementing and the reviewer reviewing |
| A spec split into tickets with blocking edges | `/native-implement-spec-routed-{host} <spec>` | Works the ready frontier in parallel worktrees, merges onto one integration branch, reviews once at the end |
| Several routed sessions running and you lose track of them | `/native-watch-{host} start` | A cron job in this session patrols the registered runs, reports only changes, rebuilds the background of each pending decision, and relays your answers. `/native-watch-{host} stop` ends it |
| Want other models, or something stopped working | `/native-routed-setup-{host}` | Detects, suggests models, writes after you confirm, re-checks. `/native-routed-setup-{host} check` only reports |
